            "body": ">       if vim.fn[\"has\"](\"clipboard\") == 0 then\n>         vim.g.clipboard = \"osc52\"\n>       else\n>         vim.g.clipboard = \"unnameplus\"\n\nthe `vim.g.clipboard = \"unnameplus\"` part should use `vim.o`, not `vim.g`.\n\n`g:clipboard` (the _provider_) is unrelated to the 'clipboard' _option_.\n",
